---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    
    <!-- SEO Meta Tags -->
    <title>Privacy Policy — AttendEase Attendance Tracker</title>
    <meta name="description" content="AttendEase Privacy Policy. Learn how we protect your attendance data. All data is stored locally in your browser. No account registration required. 100% private attendance tracking." />
    <meta name="keywords" content="privacy policy, attendance tracker privacy, data protection, student privacy, local storage privacy" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    
    <!-- Open Graph -->
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Privacy Policy — AttendEase" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="AttendEase is a 100% private attendance tracker. All data stored locally in your browser. No account required." />
    
    <!-- Canonical -->
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://atteendease.com/privacy" />
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-bg-primary text-text-primary font-sans">
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-bg-secondary/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-border">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M9 11l3 3 8-8"></path>
              <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">AttendEase</span>
        </a>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <a href="/about" class="text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">About</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">Contact</a>
          <a href="/faq" class="text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-24">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-8">Last updated: January 2026</p>
      
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">AttendEase is a free attendance tracker application designed specifically for students. We value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle your data when you use AttendEase.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Data Collection</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">AttendEase operates entirely on your device using browser localStorage. We do not collect, store, or transmit any of your personal data to external servers. The only data stored on your device includes:</p>
        <ul class="text-text-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Course information (course names, codes, colors)</li>
          <li>Timetable/schedule data</li>
          <li>Attendance records (dates, attendance status)</li>
          <li>Extra class information</li>
          <li>Application settings and preferences</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Local Storage</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">All your attendance data is stored locally in your web browser's localStorage. This means:</p>
        <ul class="text-text-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Your data never leaves your device</li>
          <li>No data is transmitted to any server</li>
          <li>No account registration is required</li>
          <li>We cannot access your attendance records</li>
          <li>Your data is 100% private and under your control</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">AttendEase does not use cookies or any tracking technologies. We do not track your usage patterns, collect analytics, or use third-party tracking services.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">AttendEase does not integrate with any third-party services that would transmit your data. The application is self-contained and operates entirely within your browser.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. Data Security</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">Since your data is stored locally on your device, its security depends on your device's security practices. We recommend:</p>
        <ul class="text-text-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Keeping your device secure with a password or biometric lock</li>
          <li>Not sharing your device with unauthorized users</li>
          <li>Regularly backing up your device</li>
          <li>Clearing browser data only when you want to delete your attendance records</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">Your attendance data remains on your device until you choose to delete it. You can delete your data at any time by:</p>
        <ul class="text-text-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Using the "Reset All Data" option in the application settings</li>
          <li>Clearing your browser's localStorage</li>
          <li>Uninstalling or clearing data from your browser</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">AttendEase is designed for students of all ages. Since we do not collect any personal data and all information is stored locally on the user's device, we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please contact us through our Contact page. We will respond to your inquiries within a reasonable timeframe.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 border-t border-border">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M9 11l3 3 8-8"></path>
              <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">AttendEase</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">© 2026 AttendEase. Free attendance tracker for students.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      }
      .prose h2 {
        color: var(--color-text-primary);
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }
      .prose p, .prose ul, .prose li {
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
